<x-layout title="A home for independent minds"><div class="legal-page"><h1>Written by the people.<br><em>Read by everyone.</em></h1><div class="prose"><p>Some of the best stories come from unexpected places. A conversation on a train. A question that won’t leave you alone. Someone seeing the everyday a little differently.</p><p>Folkscript is a home for those stories. An open publishing platform for independent voices and curious readers, built around a simple belief: everyone has something worth saying.</p><h2>A little more perspective.</h2><p>Explore writing about design, culture, technology, travel, and the texture of everyday life. Follow the writers who make you think, save a story for later, and bring your own experience to the conversation.</p><h2>Your words, your voice.</h2><p>A focused editor gives your ideas room to grow. Start a draft, add images, return to an earlier revision, and publish when you’re ready. Built-in discovery tools help your stories find their readers.</p><h2>A thoughtful community.</h2><p>We ask for curiosity, generosity, and respect. Disagreement is welcome. Harassment, plagiarism, and attempts to harm others are not. Reports reach a human moderation queue.</p><p>This local edition includes original sample stories and fictional writer profiles to demonstrate the platform. It is ready for you to make it your own.</p><a href="{{ auth()->check() ? '/write' : '/register' }}" class="btn btn-primary">{{ auth()->check() ? __('Start writing') : __('Create an account') }} <x-icon name="arrow-up-right" size="17" /></a></div></div></x-layout>
